	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"5869f3e35b5e97c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Efforts at Disarmament in 1920s\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":0,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"5fba04301dd55b37",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**League Commission to Prepare for World disarmament conference (1926) - Failure**\n* failed as Britain and France refused to Cooperate",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":217,
			"width":520,
			"height":203,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"5e6d2106e2cb5f50",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Kellogg - Briand Pact (1928) - Failure**\n* Negotiated outside the league between 15 countries including the US, France, Germany, Britain, Italy, Japan\n* Agreement that force should not be used to settle disputes\n* No clear way to enforce the pact",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":237,
			"y":217,
			"width":463,
			"height":303,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"b9a84b471ec76f3c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Washington Naval Conference (1921) - Success**\n* Negotiated outside the league to limit size and number of warships held by Britain, France, Japan and United states. \n* Organized by the US, which was not a league member\n* Ratio of tonnage of capital ships of Britain, the US, Japan, France, Italy set at 5:5:3:1.67: 1.67\n\nLinked to [[London Naval Conference, 1930]]\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-560,
			"y":-720,
			"width":480,
			"height":450,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"3651f7d9016f65aa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Locarno Treaties (1925) - Partial Success**\n* Negotiated outside the league between Britain, Germany, France, Italy, Belgium, Poland and Czechoslovakia\n* Germany accepted its western borders, including the demilitarization of rhineland\n* Weimar Government agreed to settle any disputes with above mentioned countries through the league",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":237,
			"y":-560,
			"width":560,
			"height":440,
			"color":"3"
		}
	],
